WEBVTT

00:08:31.590 --> 00:08:35.302
A lonely road is a bodyguard

00:08:36.971 --> 00:08:39.014
If we really want it to be

00:08:39.056 --> 00:08:40.307
(Music ends)

00:08:41.809 --> 00:08:45.437
We're all just radios

00:08:45.479 --> 00:08:48.524
hoping to pick up each other's signals.

00:08:48.941 --> 00:08:53.070
And some of those signals
have a backbeat and a melody,

00:08:53.070 --> 00:08:54.780
and they're universal.

00:08:55.447 --> 00:08:59.326
And music can unlock a frozen memory

00:08:59.368 --> 00:09:02.705
that melts into the seeds
of our creativity.